ab5-706a-4b6e-bd98-cca7d5e02666?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0d7c97036dcc2a19cfc029d5d9c593d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/da3c9311/uploads/origins/c1d67ab5-706a-4b6e-bd98-cca7d5e02666?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0d7c97036dcc2a19cfc029d5d9c593d, https://si.imgix.net/da3c9311/uploads/origins/c1d67ab5-706a-4b6e-bd98-cca7d5e02666?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e82cbdaaf1b459c366309cfe4692e25 2x, https://si.imgix.net/da3c9311/uploads/origins/c1d67ab5-706a-4b6e-bd98-cca7d5e02666?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6879d8c65d6ad9290b1bbe0fd3d00e48 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello sensei.\n\nI love your poses and expressions that you draw.\n\nI would like to request my character Alicia. Alicia is an anxious but curious girl who lacks confidence. She loves to explore her magical world and loves to read.\n\nPlease draw her in a cute pose with a pouting expression. She can be standing or sitting down. I will leave all composition and details to sensei.\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/23pn4u0z36w", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@naooo_03/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed0517b5/uploads/origins/a506b83f-0f4a-48b5-b8fa-3aa1d7c88e14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b911cc373a0564600872e939a2dd655", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed0517b5/uploads/origins/a506b83f-0f4a-48b5-b8fa-3aa1d7c88e14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b911cc373a0564600872e939a2dd655, https://si.imgix.net/ed0517b5/uploads/origins/a506b83f-0f4a-48b5-b8fa-3aa1d7c88e14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4cabaf3415cd2370baad5ed4751b622 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed0517b5/uploads/origins/a506b83f-0f4a-48b5-b8fa-